                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Consul General Hanna</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 28, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Silliman sends following telegram referring to mining tax:</p>
                <p>[Quotes his telegram of July 26.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
